{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "John Meets Sandra"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Hook, Line, and Sinker"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 7}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le07ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "high seas"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the part of a sea that's far away from land"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The cruise ship is sailing in the high seas. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to describe someone."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Describing People"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you describe people, you use adjectives to describe their physical appearance and personality."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the structure <span class=\"italic\">She's</span> or <span class=\"italic\">He's got ...</span> to talk about a person's physical appearance.<br/><br/>You use the structure <span class=\"italic\">She is</span> or <span class=\"italic\">He is ...</span> to talk about a person's personality."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example Adjectives on Physical Appearance\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example Adjectives on Personality\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tall \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"friendly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"slender\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"smart\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gorgeous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"warm-hearted\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"toned\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"understanding\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"elegant\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"passionate\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "She's got a tall and slender figure, and she's so friendly and warm-hearted."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Past Tense & The Past Continuous Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use a verb in the Simple Past tense with a verb in the Past Continuous tense when you talk about what you were doing when something else happened."}, {"type": "example", "content": "She was having lunch when I called her. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "She called back while I was working."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to gain"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to learn something new; to get experience"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter really gained some knowledge to help with his job at the workshop."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to ask someone to go out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to ask someone to go out on a date"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Michael asked Alysha to go out to a movie."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sinker"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an unsuccessful question or suggestion"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: John's line to ask Sandra to go out was a real sinker."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "warm-hearted"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describes someone who is very kind"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sandra is a very friendly and warm-hearted person. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "understanding"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describes someone who shows sympathy or that they understand a problem well"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sandra was very understanding that John was nervous."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "passionate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describes someone feel strongly about something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sandra is passionate about good quality coffee."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "toned"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "muscles that are firm"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sandra has a toned body because she exercises a lot."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob06aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to sway"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move slowly from side to side"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sandra's hair sways elegantly when she walks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob06aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Using adjectives for appearance and personality, describe a colleague."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write sentences on what else was happening when you did something or what someone else was doing when you did something. Use a Past tense verb and a Past Continuous verb in the same sentence. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I describe someone's appearance and personality."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write sentences to talk about what was happening or what someone else was doing when I did something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express completed events in the past and the continual events in the past in the same statement."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le07ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le07ob06re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le07ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hi, John. How's life in the high seas?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Getting better, Peter. I gained some insight from that workshop on customer service, like greeting every customer and starting a loyalty program on the ship.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Excellent! How is Sandra?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Oh, she's intelligent and funny with a sweet smile. I asked her to go out for a coffee.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le07ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Nice going.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: My line was a real sinker, but she's so warm-hearted and understanding that she accepted. She called back while I was working. And she's really passionate about good coffee.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: When I got the last message from you, you were describing how lovely she is.", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "image": "engenn5le07ob06re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Yeah, she has a gorgeous figure that's reall